WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.470
Welcome, this is the
end of our second week

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.410
here at the Largo Theater

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:10.220
and it's really nice, wonderful
to be out of the house

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.960
and working in a safe, open environment.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.110
Let me tell you something very quickly

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:15.943
about the Largo Theater.

00:00:15.943 --> 00:00:17.860
There's a lot of strange stuff in here.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.000
It's a very popular comedy theater,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.291
all the great comics perform here

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:27.470
and there's lots of
weird mementos backstage,

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:32.090
and I've spent a lot of time
here and I keep seeing this.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:37.090
It's a pillow, a pillow
that's crocheted to look like.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.560
I don't know if you can
see this, Sarah Silverman

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.340
and this is something I look
at a hundred times a day

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:47.790
while I'm here at the theater

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.900
and I have to say, I know
Sarah well, love her,

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.731
she's fantastic, very beautiful woman.

00:00:52.731 --> 00:00:57.731
This pillow doesn't really do her justice.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.850
I don't think this is an
accurate representation

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.460
of Sarah Silverman

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:07.840
and so what I'm going to do
before I leave this theater,

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.590
when it's time for us to move on,

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:14.590
is I'm going to have, I swear,
a better, more beautiful,

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:20.240
less dirty and musty Sarah
Silverman, pillow made

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.363
and that's my promise to America.

